Frieren Journey layout for Herdr

mods/journey-chrome, mods/journey-spaces, mods/journey-tabs and mods/journey-party are modified
copies of the traveler-chrome, traveler-spaces, traveler-tabs and traveler-agents mods of the
Traveler layout for Herdr (https://github.com/franky5440-afk/herdr-traveler, Copyright 2026
Frank Lin, Apache License 2.0). Those in turn derive from the built-in workspace-chrome, spaces
and tabs mods of Herdr 0.1.11 (Apache License 2.0). mods/pane-account is a modified copy of
Herdr's built-in pane mod.

Changes in the journey mods: Frieren characters and places instead of Traveler's, English text,
HP/MP bars from the usage-gauge readings, the account, model and resumed session title on each
card, a "Journey · Day N" counter, and Windows window buttons. The license text is in
LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Images are not covered by the Apache License. See "Credits" in README.md.
